{"id":"n28460-1-12","stage":4,"title":"겨드랑이 · 腋下","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28460-1-12-1","ko":"여름에는 겨드랑이에서 땀 냄새가 많이 나요.","zh":"夏天时，腋下很容易有汗味。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여름에는","meaning":"夏，夏天，夏季","explanation":"여름：夏，夏天，夏季；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"여름","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67701","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"겨드랑이에서","meaning":"腋下，胳肢窝","explanation":"겨드랑이：腋下，胳肢窝；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"겨드랑이","audio":"/audio/7a56407ae9f170ff1045.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28460","senseId":"1","lemma":"겨드랑이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"땀","meaning":"汗","explanation":"땀：汗","readings":[{"term":"땀","audio":"/audio/4a87f76767f67dcdd48c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50523","senseId":"1","lemma":"땀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"냄새가","meaning":"气味，味道，香味，臭味","explanation":"냄새：气味，味道，香味，臭味；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"냄새","audio":"/audio/a67d0d1b921d4bc49922.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58180","senseId":"1","lemma":"냄새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나요.","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4442e49ca3d7c1ba","term":"여름","zh":"夏，夏天，夏季","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3","entryId":"67701","definition":"四季之一，介于春秋之间的季节。","pronunciation":["여름"]},{"id":"7a56407ae9f170ff","term":"겨드랑이","zh":"腋下，胳肢窝","audio":"/audio/7a56407ae9f170ff1045.mp3","entryId":"28460","definition":"连着肩膀的双臂下面凹下去的地方。","pronunciation":["겨드랑이"]},{"id":"4a87f76767f67dcd","term":"땀","zh":"汗","audio":"/audio/4a87f76767f67dcdd48c.mp3","entryId":"50523","definition":"感到热、身体不舒服或紧张时通过皮肤分泌的咸津津的清澈液体。","pronunciation":["땀"]},{"id":"a67d0d1b921d4bc4","term":"냄새","zh":"气味，味道，香味，臭味","audio":"/audio/a67d0d1b921d4bc49922.mp3","entryId":"58180","definition":"能用鼻子闻到的味儿。","pronunciation":["냄ː새"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1efa312a42dfb8819048.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28460-1-12-2","ko":"그건 그 부위가 몸에서 땀이 많이 나는 부분이어서 그래요.","zh":"那是因为那个部位是身体出汗最厉害的地方。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그건","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그거：那个；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"그거","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62251","senseId":"2","lemma":"그거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부위가","meaning":"部位","explanation":"부위：部位；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"부위","audio":"/audio/e3604ccf3e0264077dda.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26319","senseId":"1","lemma":"부위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몸에서","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"땀이","meaning":"汗","explanation":"땀：汗；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"땀","audio":"/audio/4a87f76767f67dcdd48c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50523","senseId":"1","lemma":"땀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나는","meaning":"流","explanation":"나다：流；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"18","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부분이어서","meaning":"部分","explanation":"부분：部分；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"부분","audio":"/audio/204cbadbdb5dd2ee0cb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65853","senseId":"1","lemma":"부분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래요.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4e2a8844f69b923d","term":"그거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3","entryId":"62251","definition":"指代前面已提到过的对象。","pronunciation":["그거"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"e3604ccf3e026407","term":"부위","zh":"部位","audio":"/audio/e3604ccf3e0264077dda.mp3","entryId":"26319","definition":"整个身体中某一特定部分所在的位置。","pronunciation":["부위"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"4a87f76767f67dcd","term":"땀","zh":"汗","audio":"/audio/4a87f76767f67dcdd48c.mp3","entryId":"50523","definition":"感到热、身体不舒服或紧张时通过皮肤分泌的咸津津的清澈液体。","pronunciation":["땀"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"流","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"身上流出汗、血、泪水等。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"204cbadbdb5dd2ee","term":"부분","zh":"部分","audio":"/audio/204cbadbdb5dd2ee0cb9.mp3","entryId":"65853","definition":"构成整体的小范围；或指把整体分为多个时的其中一个。","pronunciation":["부분"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/2f70feaf5574b9f58b6f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.085,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28460","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":147,"sequenceScore":2.9117,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那是因为那个部位是身体出汗最厉害的地方。","承奎考上大学了吗？","夏天时，腋下很容易有汗味。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那是因为那个部位是身体出汗最厉害的地方。","夏天时，腋下很容易有汗味。","承奎考上大学了吗？"],"answer":0}]}
